      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "KING OF THE TOWN (1) resumes here and is yet to place in two previous fresh runs but has never run first-up over this trip. Got to Listed grade last time in and can show up here. GIBRALTAR (2) was in the firing line on the bend and progressed nicely last start to finish a close second over 1700m at this track after missing the placings at the previous appearance. Finds a suitable race and can play a major role. POINT GOLD BEAU (4) made progress last time out, finishing 2.25 lengths from the winner in third at the end of 1700m at this track. Finds a nice race and can build on that solid recent effort. JESA LUPA (5) did little the first three runs back but was an improved effort last time and might be ready to go on with it.",
